  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assessment of Green City Kigali (GCK) project business and delivery models</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Government of Rwanda(GoR) plans to develop Green City Kigali (GCK) project on a 600 Ha. Kinyinya hill as a model of green urbanization in Rwanda linking green affordable housing with climate change adaptation and mitigation measures to set a standard for sustainable urban development in Rwanda. They would like to begin this by developing a pilot project of 16 Ha.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support FONERWA, KfW and GCKJC board to make an informed decision on the most optimum business and delivery model for GC</narrative>
  </description>
